<h2 id="3-below-water">3. Below Water</h2>
<p>Still in the rough area of Hasselt/Diepenbeek/Genk, we find a bridge that&rsquo;s not really a bridge but rather a way <em>downwards</em>. In the Provincial Domain Bokrijk, you can cycle straight through the water and meet the ducks and swans eye to eye instead of from the usual height. Too bad the sides aren&rsquo;t made from some kind of translucent material. Our kids love this, and it&rsquo;s a real tourist attraction.</p>
