</p>
<p>The photo was taken from the right side where you can take a big ramp up in two parts including a U-turn to reach the top of the bridge, only to cycle back down in a circular style on the far left, reaching the campus buildings of the business department. Fortunately, pedestrians can take a shortcut via two connected staircases in-between the turns. There are even cosy looking benches placed halfway towards the top to enjoy your lunch on a sunny day.</p>


          
